Description: VeltOS PDF Reader, a modern PDF reader
 Reads PDF documents in a modern reader layout: Home with the recent
 files, one tab per document, continuous pages with selectable text,
 search with results, page thumbnails, bookmarks (outline), zoom, fit
 width or page, rotate, read mode, full screen, document properties,
 passwords and printing. Pages are drawn by Qt PDF (PDFium).
